          "value": "To find the $y$-intercepts of the hyperbola, we substitute $x=0$ into the equation of the hyperbola and solve for $y,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}7{y}^{2}-5{x}^{2} & =28 \\\\ 7{y}^{2}-5(0)^{2} & =28 \\\\ 7{y}^{2} & =28 \\\\ {y}^{2} & =4 \\\\ y & =\\pm 2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the $y$-intercepts are $(0,\\pm 2).$",
